      "message": "[1] The Problem is BGL only knows ExternalTextureBinding, but BG can bind ExternalTexture or textureView to ExternalTextureBindingEntry. I don\u0027t see how to do index random access instead of push_back to `mBoundExternalTextures`. And that makes we cannot have the map of `APIBindingIndex` to index in `BindGroup::mBoundExternalTextures` in BGL (instead of in BG).\n\ne.g.\nbgl \u003d {external_texture_binding, external_texture_binding}\n\nbg1 \u003d {external_texture_0, external_texture_1} mBoundExternalTextures \u003d {external_texture_0, external_texture_1} that_map \u003d { 0: 0, 1: 1}\n\nbg2 \u003d {texture_view_0, external_texture_0} mBoundExternalTextures \u003d {external_texture_0} that_map \u003d {1: 0}",
